Build the single-threaded dispatcher

Without the multithreaded feature the dispatcher still asks whether memory
is shared before running its waker loop, but the check was compiled only
with the feature, so gpui_web failed to build single-threaded. The check
needs nothing the feature brings.

License: Apache-2.0 (Zed v1.6.3)
--- a/crates/gpui_web/src/dispatcher.rs
+++ b/crates/gpui_web/src/dispatcher.rs
@@ -10,7 +10,6 @@
 #[cfg(feature = "multithreaded")]
 const MIN_BACKGROUND_THREADS: usize = 2;
 
-#[cfg(feature = "multithreaded")]
 fn shared_memory_supported() -> bool {
     let global = js_sys::global();
     let has_shared_array_buffer =
